<title>AUSTRIA: Austria July c/a deficit swells to 7.9 bln ats.</title>
<headline>Austria July c/a deficit swells to 7.9 bln ats.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN CURRENT ACCOUNT	JULY	JUNE	   JULY 95</p>
<p> Current account balance ATS -7.9 bln   -5.5 bln	  -5.9</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance   -8.0 bln   -2.5 bln	  -6.6</p>
<p> Exports			   64.4 bln   66.2 bln	  62.4</p>
<p> Imports			   72.4 bln   68.7 bln	  69.0</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JANUARY-JULY)</p>
<p> Current account balance    -30.4 bln  -22.5 bln	 -26.4</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance  -45.6 bln  -37.6 bln	 -47.4</p>
<p> Exports			  437.2 bln  372.8 bln	 420.7</p>
<p> Imports			  482.8 bln  410.4 bln	 468.1</p>
<p>-- Janet McBride, Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-254</p>
</text>
